OL,3,GNEWSAMarathon man, 85, eyes 200-mile
OL,4,Achallenge in USA
OL,5,
OL,6,FRay Matthews is no stranger to extreme
OL,7,Fchallenges - after all, when he turned
OL,8,F75 the keen runner marked the milestone
OL,9,Fby running the equivalent of 75
OL,10,Fmarathon distances in 75 days. Ten
OL,11,Fyears on, his passion for running
OL,12,Fremains undimmed.
OL,14,FMatthews, from Rotherham, has now set
OL,15,Fhis sights on taking part in next
OL,16,Fyear's Bigfoot 200 ultra-marathon in
OL,17,Fthe USA, whose 200-mile (322km) route
OL,18,Fwill take him through Washington
OL,19,FState's Cascade Mountains.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
