OL,3,GNEWSAMarathon man, 85, eyes 200-mile
OL,4,Achallenge in USA
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I feel I can do it. I know I can do
OL,7,Fit," the 85-year-old says with
OL,8,Fdetermination.
OL,10,F"What I need to do now is to knuckle
OL,11,Fdown and start big time training."
